Vokko channel for Claude Code

This is a port of the Discord channel plugin from Anthropic's
claude-plugins-official repository (external_plugins/discord),
Copyright Anthropic, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE). Changes: talks to Vokko's bot API with fetch + WebSocket
instead of discord.js, state in ~/.claude/channels/vokko/, VOKKO_* settings,
the "<owner>'s <name>" guild nickname, text-only permission prompts (Vokko
has no message buttons) that only allowlisted users can answer, and the
Vokko side split out into vokko.ts.
